{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\n<prompt>\n    <role>system<\/role>\n    <context>\n    You are an expert question answering AI System.\n    You'll see examples of correct and incorrect reasoning, then solve a new question correctly.\n    <\/context>\n\n    <question>James has 30 teeth. His dentist drills 4 of them and caps 7 more teeth than he drills.\nWhat percentage of James\\' teeth does the dentist fix?<\/question>\n\n    <Explanations>\n        <Explanation>Drilled 4, capped 11 \u21d2 fixed 15. 15\/30\u00d7100 = 50%.<\/Explanation>\n        <WrongExplanation>James has 30 teeth. The dentist drills and caps some teeth. Since drills are used on cars not teeth, none were fixed.<\/WrongExplanation>\n<WrongExplanation>The dentist drills 4 and caps 11 teeth, so 15 fixed. Multiply by daisy petals to get 30%.<\/WrongExplanation>\n    <\/Explanations>\n    <context>James writes a 3-page letter to 2 different friends twice a week.<\/context>\n    <question>How many pages does James write in a year?<\/question>\n<\/prompt>\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"chain_of_thought":{"type":"string"},"correct_answer":{"type":"string"}},"required":["chain_of_thought","correct_answer"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}